-- =====================================================================================================================
-- ACTIONX_UDQ: run-time logic of an ECLIPSE / OPM deck in the ResSim engine (C31)
--   * UDQ  - user-defined quantities: field water cut, an injection target from voidage, a producer rate limit
--   * UDA  - the producer ORAT limit and the injector RATE come from UDQs (re-evaluated every time step)
--   * ACTIONX - a producer whose water cut exceeds 0.8 at the end of a report step is shut ('?' = the triggering
--     wells, up to 4 runs); once the voidage replacement has raised the field pressure above 5300 psi the producer limit is raised (UDQ ASSIGN
--     inside the action) and the injector BHP limit is lowered to 5800 psi (WELTARG)
-- The same deck runs unchanged in OPM Flow / ECLIPSE (UDQ / ACTIONX are kept verbatim on import / export).
-- 11 x 11 x 3, FIELD units, SPE1 fluids, 5-spot with an off-centre producer (P1 breaks through first)
-- =====================================================================================================================
RUNSPEC

TITLE
ACTIONX + UDQ + UDA waterflood (11x11x3, FIELD)

DIMENS
 11 11 3 /

OIL
WATER
GAS
DISGAS

FIELD

TABDIMS
 1 1 20 20 /

EQLDIMS
 1 1* 20 /

WELLDIMS
 5 3 1 5 /

UDQDIMS
 50 25 0 50 50 0 0 50 0 20 /

UDADIMS
 10 1* 10 /

ACTDIMS
 4 50 80 8 /

START
 1 'JAN' 2025 /

UNIFOUT

GRID

DX
 363*300
/

DY
 363*300
/

DZ
 121*20 121*30 121*40
/

TOPS
 121*8325
/

PORO
 363*0.22
/

PERMX
 121*400 121*120 121*250
/

PERMY
 121*400 121*120 121*250
/

PERMZ
 121*40 121*12 121*25
/

